== Structure of the report

Chapters 2 to 8 describe the operation of the network from source to tap. Chapter 9 reports on drinking water quality compliance, and chapter 10 on monitoring and telemetry. Chapter 11 covers health, safety and the environment, and chapter 12 sets out the outlook and the investment programme. Each chapter starts with a short summary and ends with the main actions for the coming year.

