= Outlook and Investment Programme

The investment programme for the next five years focuses on mains renewal, leakage reduction, resilience of supplies to the coastal zone, and the replacement of ageing telemetry. This chapter summarises the programme and the targets for the coming year.

== Investment programme

The programme for the coming year includes the renewal of 48 kilometres of mains, a second transfer main to the coastal zone, and the refurbishment of the filters at two treatment works. #bold-if-after[Capital expenditure remains subject to board approval] of the detailed business cases, which are expected in the spring.

